        "quote_english": "However, employees working through outside agencies, volunteers and contract employees whose family income is up to Rs 2.5 lakh will be eligible"
      },
      "confidence": 0.8
    },
    {
      "change_id": "c3",
      "scheme_id": "mh.ladki_bahin",
