    date: 2024-08-01
    person: {<<: *base, family_farm_land_acres: 5}
    expect: {eligible: true}
    source: GR 202407031335114330 p.2 clause 5(7)

  - name: 5.5 acres of farm land is eligible from 2024-07-03 because the condition is removed
